edits_description = "The camel, its handler, and the distance houses with their greenery were removed."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_5vv68")
blurb = "Depicts the outside of the Tartar Wall, the southern boundary of the inner-city wall of old Peking, at dusk. Under an indigo blue sky, a lone traveler and his camel stop for a drink. The pool reflects the dark sky and the silhouette of the wall.

This wall has been demolished since, today the 2nd Ring Road in Beijing cuts over where it once stood."
